  "totalBlocks": 58,
  "translatedBlocks": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c86e378ac8093dd",
      "translationZh": "作者：Intel AI Software Group",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2b15802624191f4",
      "translationZh": "DeepMath 是一个基于 Qwen3-4B Thinking 构建、并使用 GRPO（组相对策略优化）进行微调的对齐数学推理智能体。该模型不使用冗长的文本，而是为中间步骤生成简短的 Python 代码片段，在安全沙箱中运行它们，再将结果融入推理过程，从而减少错误并缩短输出长度。该智能体使用 smolagents 库实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b619753509901b4",
      "translationZh": "我们在四个数学数据集上评估了 DeepMath：MATH500、AIME、HMMT 和 HLE，结果表明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c985f2cb328ec2bf",
      "translationZh": "🤖 仅使用数学智能体，就能将输出长度最多缩短 66%，同时往往还能提高准确率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56ad5b97dbd66005",
      "translationZh": "⚡ 在几乎所有基准测试中，GRPO 训练都能进一步提升智能体的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eea2409c2d845b8",
      "translationZh": "👉 代码和评估脚本：https://github.com/IntelLabs/DeepMath 👉 模型：https://huggingface.co/Intel/deepmath-v1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7ccb4deeafcc3c90",
      "translationZh": "为什么选择 DeepMath？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc640a13b6de4661",
      "translationZh": "大型语言模型（LLM）具备先进的推理能力，但解决数学问题仍然充满挑战；思维链轨迹可能很长，而且容易出现算术错误。近期研究[^1][^2]表明，小模型也能取得出色表现，另有研究[^3]探索了通过使用工具来提高可靠性。这些论文通常没有强调的是减少推理轨迹的冗长程度，或显式训练模型，使其偏好简短、以计算为导向、在受限且可审计的环境中执行的推理轨迹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "469d91f292bf0984",
      "translationZh": "我们重点关注两个目标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5a66a6a2e64967f",
      "translationZh": "将确定性计算交由安全的执行器处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "872b1cf776b21318",
      "translationZh": "训练模型，使其更倾向于生成简洁、以计算为导向的推理轨迹，而非冗长的文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fa08b0498d4188e",
      "translationZh": "DeepMath 将一个小型 Python 执行器与经过微调的 LLM 相结合，以此实现简洁、由计算驱动的推理。模型学习生成简短的 Python 代码片段，这些片段在沙箱中执行，执行结果随后被重新整合到上下文中。GRPO 微调通过奖励正确性并鼓励更短的输出来促进这种行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1879525c75cb5c2",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "640511e10f6f31e9",
      "translationZh": "基础模型：Qwen3-4B Thinking。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83cf1b9798337088",
      "translationZh": "执行器约束：沙箱环境、导入模块白名单、每个代码片段的执行超时限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02a5f5d302132718",
      "translationZh": "推理：基于 smolagents 创建了一个数学智能体。使用 vLLM 作为推理引擎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1529ae24007e37b7",
      "translationZh": "训练：基于 TRL 中的 GRPO 训练器，我们修改了 TRL 的 vLLM 客户端和服务器，以使用我们的 DeepMath 智能体生成 GRPO 补全内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f657da318483db5",
      "translationZh": "图 1：对 vLLM 客户端和服务器进行了修改，使其在使用 vLLM 后端的同时，通过 DeepMath 智能体生成候选内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30f60b650ed50b21",
      "translationZh": "智能体接口：在推理过程中，模型可以输出普通词元，也可以输出包含 Python 代码片段的特殊智能体调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eea234d364c8f6a2",
      "translationZh": "执行：代码片段在具有严格安全约束的沙箱环境中运行（禁止文件 I/O、禁止网络访问、设有超时限制）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d40f71eab174b65",
      "translationZh": "设计目标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57753e0d214c3716",
      "translationZh": "简洁性：用简短、专注的代码片段替代多行文本计算过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3f27aa088ea4d9f",
      "translationZh": "确定性与安全性：强制实施严格的执行限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3a39b3e099fbdcf",
      "translationZh": "可解释性：代码片段可读且可审计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b750998356b3729",
      "translationZh": "图 2：输出示例，其中生成并执行了 python 代码，答案被插入推理轨迹并用作上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "90bd8808bcdb4a06",
      "translationZh": "使用 GRPO 进行训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae21cd244cf5be63",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 GRPO 对模型进行微调，这是一种基于奖励的优化方法，会平衡以下各项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf9d99cc20435a3a",
      "translationZh": "准确性奖励：回答正确可获得 +1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a3fd6e1ee44f426",
      "translationZh": "使用代码片段：生成代码片段可获得 +1，该奖励与准确性奖励的权重比为 10:1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e27cebf811dc8c2",
      "translationZh": "缩短长度：将 GRPO 的候选补全限制为 5k tokens，以鼓励更短的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96f9283860cfa3c2",
      "translationZh": "温度调度：我们采用了线性温度调度（T=1.2 → T=0.7），以平衡训练过程中的探索与稳定性。这种方法旨在训练初期鼓励更多尝试，随后随着我们对该技能的掌握更加熟练，逐步降低温度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55450ad1a540ed36",
      "translationZh": "上下文学习：我们加入了 4 个已解答的示例，其推理轨迹包含智能体调用和执行器输出，使模型能够学会相应的语法以及调用/响应模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2d62bab6bc08c81",
      "translationZh": "数据集：我们使用了 OpenMathReasoning 数据集中的工具集成推理（Tool-Integrated Reasoning，TIR）子集。请注意，GRPO 仅使用数据中的问题，不使用解答。选择该数据集是为了确保其中的问题能够受益于外部工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4176e5869811bdb8",
      "translationZh": "我们在四个数据集上对 DeepMath 与基线进行了基准测试。指标包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04f7b5cbf3c66031",
      "translationZh": "majority@16：衡量不同采样结果之间的稳健性，此前的数学推理研究也使用了这一指标，详见参考文献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c12554655749c6",
      "translationZh": "平均输出长度：衡量简洁性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f20392c661d2a5a",
      "translationZh": "我们将基线配置（Qwen3-4B-Thinking-2507，不采用智能体方式）与我们的 DeepMath 模型进行比较。在消融实验中，我们评估了所开发的智能体框架搭配未经训练的 Qwen3 模型运行时的表现，记为 +Agent。此外，我们还考察了面向智能体使用的 GRPO 训练是否能改善非智能体推理，记为 +GRPO。因此，这两项消融实验彼此独立，而非叠加。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98a5099272ad8f83",
      "translationZh": "我们观察到，智能体推理缩短了输出长度，但准确率的变化有升有降。DeepMath 模型既经过 GRPO 训练，又以智能体模式运行，在缩短推理轨迹的同时取得了最高准确率。我们得出的结论是，要获得最佳结果，GRPO 训练和智能体推理缺一不可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0555b727b8102f37",
      "translationZh": "关键洞见：DeepMath 将输出长度最多缩短 66%，同时提高了在具有挑战性的数据集上的准确率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "907cb233cae6f6b8",
      "translationZh": "为何重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6afdbd634aa5127",
      "translationZh": "准确性：将计算交由外部执行可减少算术错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbbf0ddcad6a74dd",
      "translationZh": "效率：更短的输出意味着更快的推理速度，也更易于解释。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8fe8a1306a0f38e",
      "translationZh": "安全性：沙箱执行可降低运行任意代码的风险。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b152173d377ceadd",
      "translationZh": "DeepMath 展示了一种实用且轻量的方法，将小型执行器与 LLM 相结合，并训练模型使其偏好简短、由计算驱动的推理轨迹。将确定性计算交由外部执行，可以减少算术和数值错误，并缩短推理轨迹，而 GRPO 微调则进一步鼓励模型给出简洁、正确的答案。最终得到的是一个更准确、可解释性更强的数学求解智能体，而无需庞大的模型或重量级外部工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6cc247079cbab65d",
      "translationZh": "亲自尝试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62010685dc9c850a",
      "translationZh": "查看 GitHub 仓库，并分享你的反馈！欢迎贡献。🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2955789aa4f8eb36",
      "translationZh": "引用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1485e584bf294989",
      "translationZh": "如果你在研究中使用 DeepMath，请引用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36c0d67188292440",
      "translationZh": "局限性与未来工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "308b4a065a186d4f",
      "translationZh": "范围：我们聚焦于小模型和数学推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9fdec03cf295453",
      "translationZh": "泛化能力：评估基于竞赛风格的数学题；结果可能无法迁移到开放式数学创造或形式化证明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "591c0c210d290963",
      "translationZh": "执行生成的代码本身就存在风险。DeepMath 使用严格的沙箱隔离和资源限制，但任何部署都应谨慎管理攻击面，并强制实施速率限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69824d3b0e70ca6a",
      "translationZh": "参考文献",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
